  "description": "⭐ <em>Discover one of the world’s greatest museums with an expert archaeologist as your guide on this immersive British Museum Tour, designed to uncover iconic masterpieces and fascinating hidden gems most visitors never get to see.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🏛️ Explore the British Museum with a professional archaeologist leading the way<br>\r\n🗿 See world-famous treasures including the Rosetta Stone, Ancient Egypt, and the Parthenon Marbles<br>\r\n👑 Discover powerful stories behind Pharaoh Ramses II, Assyrian Palaces, and Ancient Greece<br>\r\n🌎 Journey across civilizations with highlights like the Aztec treasures, Easter Island secrets, and Viking Chessmen<br>\r\n⚔️ Learn about the Sutton Hoo hoard and the mysterious King Raedwald of the Dark Ages<br>\r\n👥 Enjoy a small-group experience for a more personal and engaging tour<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and time: Choose your date in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏰ Time: 9:45 AM – 12:30 PM<br>\r\n👉&nbsp;Please arrive 10 minutes early<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: Approximately 2.5 hours<br>\r\n📍 Location: The British Museum, London<br>\r\n📌 Meeting point: Outside Russell Square Station, Bernard St, London WC1N 1LJ<br>\r\n👥 Maximum group size: 15 people<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: The museum is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nVisit the British Museum alongside an experienced archaeologist who will guide you through centuries of human history with clarity and insight. This carefully curated tour cuts through the vastness of the museum, focusing on its most important artifacts as well as lesser-known highlights that often go unnoticed. From Ancient Egypt and the Rosetta Stone to the Parthenon Marbles, Viking relics, and treasures of the Aztecs, each stop reveals powerful stories that shaped civilizations. Get your tickets now!",
